  "description": "XEMXAS crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C232 H192 Dy8 N48 O52,4(C1 H4 O1),12(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1G (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2G (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.543-3.543 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.67-100.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8L2_4(H2L2)4(H2O)4]·4CH3OH·12H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
